{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30013_01_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:903db93e4afd92e2b018a01e8b169973070b3cdf86fa70fd8b1c1eb3d5510029",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_i:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d06e127931026fde763dc2248b09d364d3f9f60fb118bd8d2841dbfc9c4074e",
      "text": "请用吧。这是结合了卷绪先生的\n建议后完成的新作蛋糕……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_i:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca7c58af608a75842beba3010b6cbbdc804ec767f37fd081977be7e0b68e505e",
      "text": "《Cafe Parade的Candy Pop Monster蛋糕》。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_i:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea01b44880d20b216e1aaae41882b7f2e33471e66ef753dae723e39e5bb3b3dd",
      "text": "这款蛋糕的主题是“本真的欲望”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_i:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac7f3392b05b669cf51e450d58d3bd2a127209831662e8e7e7c417be64cf2350",
      "text": "摘下乖孩子的面具，沉溺于蛋糕的甜美之中……\n我们试着将其打造成了这种具有魅惑感的味道。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_i:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:950ed6df0a524727661be153c4852a503e086ff5d38c6bff276d0f6ac30fd4dd",
      "text": "看起来好美味的巧克力蛋糕啊！\n那我这就开动了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_i:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:470edbe90617029510ca06f2154a9f48f994ea8690b41662a9feecd42ca43a97",
      "text": "……！这是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_i:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:503d85cfebdb2b4b5afa0573d07f86dbfc5169814231bd3b7ad05387a27a81ac",
      "text": "和从前尝过的诱惑祭品相比，\n简直判若两物……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_i:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:024479b5a34e2d8b8012ecc26f53f5061079748940c305e8ad074a426583d9b8",
      "text": "嗯。虽然外观乍看之下很朴素，但吃上一口\n就能明白连细节处都被照顾得面面俱到呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_i:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b311bf98c78db063d86860369d055dc1d88b0b1ffbe51f019c0728920b996985",
      "text": "嗯嗯！\n客人们一定也会喜欢的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_i:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9e0836d801ec11860d35ffe462e6ffc27a44b53f2716ca84c06c03b7d4a14f5",
      "text": "谢谢夸奖。因为从第二天起，\n也会有我以外的人来制作这款蛋糕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_i:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33e52657773cf187c7fa1bf257d79b934ebf79a09cac6833fe809a39ebae8191",
      "text": "所以我尽量考虑到了要容易重现。\n当然……绝对没有做任何妥协。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30013_01:1_3_30013_01_i:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1971d669d833ece7e63d5a82a78374ca346eedf7aec8839df2a267553779ebcb",
      "text": "裹缠着甜美暗黑之泪的罪孽深重之诱惑祭品……\n如此一来，想要诱使光之遗民堕入暗黑亦是轻而易举！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
